OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly cloud and rain will clear
OL,6,Fto the southeast to leave a mostly dry
OL,7,Fday with plenty of sunny spells then
OL,8,Ffollowing. The odd shower is possible
OL,9,Ftowards northern coasts, but most will
OL,10,Fremain dry. Rather breezy for all.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIsolated showers continuing
OL,13,Fovernight towards the north coast.
OL,14,FOtherwise a dry night with clear
OL,15,Fspells, remaining rather breezy
OL,16,Fdespite winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
