OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and bright start, but
OL,6,Fturning cloudier into the afternoon
OL,7,Fwith patchy outbreaks of, mainly
OL,8,Flight, rain spreading east. Remaining
OL,9,Frather breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,12,Fcloudy on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,13,Fpatchy rain and stronger winds.
OL,14,FBrighter to the east of high ground.
OL,15,FDrier, brighter and a little warmer on
OL,16,FMonday with lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
